營收已達 10.63 億元，超越去年全年，確立今年營收續創新高，主因消費者防詐、企業端防詐和金融科技服務等三大業務將同步擴張。 其中，消費者防詐方面，數位廣告營收年增55%、占營收比重 34%，而企業端受惠於近期與政府機構及企業客戶新簽訂多筆長約，動能可望延續。 金融科技服務方面，主要反映新服務 JUJI 招財麻吉持續成長。 Gogolook 目標長期成長優於全球產業平均，並藉由維持出色的投資效率，使獲利能有跳躍式的成長。","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["EPS/獲利","營收","法說/展望","AI/半導體","總經/聯準會"],"bull":["新高","獲利","年增","擴大"],"bear":[],"score":4,"highlights":["EPS)為1.69 元","EPS 5.2元","年增55%"],"keywords":["獲利創高","詐騙","防詐","gogolook"]},"time":"11/12 16:16"}],"fund":{"code":"6902","rev_month":"11510","rev":114855.0,"rev_mom":0.8623642127633416,"rev_yoy":18.29014583504985,"rev_cum_yoy":25.882840432836883,"eps_q":5.02,"eps_year":"115","eps_season":"3","net_income":177509.0,"pe":19.71,"pb":5.03,"yield":null,"updated":"2026-11-13 17:58"},"tdcc":{"latest":{"date":"2026-11-06","big1000":52.76,"big400":64.95,"retail":8.08,"holders":7592},"prev":{"date":"2026-10-30","big1000":53.31,"big400":64.33,"retail":8.08,"holders":7589},"d_big1000":-0.55,"d_big400":0.62,"d_retail":0.0,"d_holders":3},"weekly":{"bars":[{"time":"2026-07-27","open":122.0,"high":123.5,"low":108.5,"close":121.0,"volume":652.0749999999999},{"time":"2026-08-03","open":121.0,"high":123.5,"low":118.5,"close":120.5,"volume":480.214},{"time":"2026-08-10","open":121.0,"high":135.5,"low":121.0,"close":132.0,"volume":609.086},{"time":"2026-08-17","open":130.0,"high":137.0,"low":125.0,"close":126.5,"volume":451.882},{"time":"2026-08-24","open":129.5,"high":129.5,"low":123.0,"close":129.5,"volume":296.603},{"time":"2026-08-31","open":127.0,"high":129.0,"low":122.5,"close":125.0,"volume":299.057},{"time":"2026-09-07","open":124.5,"high":128.0,"low":121.0,"close":121.0,"volume":349.504},{"time":"2026-09-14","open":120.5,"high":141.0,"low":120.5,"close":141.0,"volume":1188.749},{"time":"2026-09-21","open":155.0,"high":183.0,"low":155.0,"close":176.5,"volume":5791.3279999999995},{"time":"2026-09-29","open":173.0,"high":175.0,"low":149.0,"close":150.0,"volume":2160.247},{"time":"2026-10-05","open":151.0,"high":152.0,"low":135.5,"close":